---
/**
 * The last line on every page: what this site does not do.
 *
 * Every clause is measured, not aspirational, and it is worth knowing what
 * each one rests on before editing either the copy or the thing it describes:
 *
 *   "loads nothing from anyone else"  the build mirrors Shopify's product
 *                                     images into this origin — see
 *                                     shopImageMirror() in astro.config.mjs.
 *                                     Remove that and this sentence is false.
 *   "no cookies"                      verified: zero cookies set, at any point
 *                                     including after adding to cart.
 *   "no analytics, no trackers"       there is no analytics library in the
 *                                     repo at all.
 *   "until you add something"         the Storefront API call happens on that
 *                                     click and not before, and checkout is
 *                                     Shopify's own domain from there.
 *
 * Deliberately NOT "doesn't track you in any way whatsoever": Netlify logs
 * requests server-side and Shopify's checkout is Shopify's. The claim stops
 * exactly where it stops being true.
 */
---

<footer class="site-note">
  <p class="site-note__text f-bricolage">
    This site loads nothing from anyone else. No cookies, no analytics, no
    trackers. Nothing leaves this domain until you add something to your cart.
  </p>
</footer>
